@startuml state-goods
!include style.iuml
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60
hide empty description

state "PENDING\n待审核" as PENDING
state "ON_SALE\n在售" as ON_SALE #FFEDD5
state "REJECTED\n审核未通过" as REJECTED
state "RESERVED\n交易中" as RESERVED
state "SOLD\n已售出" as SOLD #E5E7EB
state "OFF_SHELF\n已下架" as OFF_SHELF

[*] -down-> PENDING : 卖家发布商品
PENDING -down-> ON_SALE : 管理员审核通过
PENDING -right-> REJECTED : 管理员驳回\n（必须填写原因）
REJECTED -up-> PENDING : 卖家修改后\n重新提交
ON_SALE -up-> PENDING : 卖家编辑商品\n（需重新审核）
ON_SALE -down-> RESERVED : 买家下单\n（条件更新防超卖）
RESERVED -up-> ON_SALE : 买家或卖家\n取消订单
RESERVED -down-> SOLD : 买家确认收货
SOLD -down-> [*]

ON_SALE -left-> OFF_SHELF : 卖家下架 /\n管理员强制下架
PENDING -left-> OFF_SHELF : 卖家下架 /\n管理员强制下架
REJECTED -down-> OFF_SHELF : 卖家下架
OFF_SHELF -up-> PENDING : 卖家重新上架 /\n编辑后提交

note right of RESERVED
  交易中、已售出的商品
  不能编辑，也不能下架
end note
note bottom of OFF_SHELF
  管理员下架时
  记录下架原因
end note
@enduml
